1
00:00:00,159 --> 00:00:03,500
Here is how you protect your caravan roof in under a minute, by yourself.

2
00:00:03,619 --> 00:00:07,839
This is a roof cover for a caravan, six point five by three meters.

3
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:13,219
It only covers the roof, not the whole caravan, no heavy tarp to pull over by yourself in the wind.

4
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:16,059
The fabric is made of heavy-duty 210 D weave.

5
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:19,420
It holds up against rain, snow, and sun all winter long outside.

6
00:00:19,579 --> 00:00:22,420
You secure it with straps and a drawstring along the edge.

7
00:00:22,459 --> 00:00:24,879
It stays in place even when it's really windy.

8
00:00:24,979 --> 00:00:26,919
One person can handle it on their own.

9
00:00:27,019 --> 00:00:28,879
No one needs to hold the other end.

10
00:00:28,899 --> 00:00:32,639
When not in use, it folds up into the included storage bag.

11
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,459
Takes up no space in the awning box.

12
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:37,840
A simple way to protect the most expensive surface on the caravan.
